.TH CIRCLETRACE 1
.SH NAME
circletrace \- circle tracing game
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/circletrace
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I CircleTrace
is a circle tracing game.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Drag button 1 around a guide circle. On release, radial error is scored; lower is better.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B LMB drag
Draw freehand around guide circle; release scores
.TP
.B Enter / r
Reset
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/circletrace.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR wm (1)
